  "properties": {
    "title": "GeoNetwork Update",
    "description": "The GeoNetwork opensource project is a catalog application that makes it easy to discover resources at local, regional, national or global level.\n\nCheck in with the GeoNetwork project as we tackle OGCAPI-Records (finally a REST API standard), advances in DCAT Application Profile (for records), and more.\r\n\r\nThis is a busy time for the project and we look forward to sharing what we are up to, some of the challenges ahead, and what to expect from this ever-evolving platform!",
